{
  "slug": "playwright-pro",
  "name": "Playwright Pro",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Playwright Pro turns your AI coding agent into a senior test automation engineer.\n\nInstead of generating tutorial-quality tests with brittle CSS selectors, Playwright Pro enforces battle-tested patterns from production test suites: role-based locators, web-first assertions, proper fixture architecture, and isolated test design.\n\nIt doesn't reinvent Claude Code — it orchestrates it. /pw:generate uses the built-in Explore subagent for codebase analysis. /pw:migrate delegates to /batch for parallel file conversion. /pw:fix leverages /debug for trace inspection. Every skill builds on what Claude Code already does well.\n\n55 ready-to-use test templates across 11 categories — authentication, CRUD, checkout, search, forms, dashboard, settings, onboarding, notifications, API testing, and accessibility. Each template includes TypeScript and JavaScript variants with parametrizable placeholders. Not generic stubs — real patterns like Stripe iframe handling, GraphQL mutation testing, and RBAC permission flows.\n\n3 specialized agents handle complex planning before a single test is written: test-architect maps your application surface, test-debugger diagnoses flaky failures systematically, and migration-planner creates ordered conversion plans from Cypress or Selenium.\n\n2 MCP integrations (TypeScript) connect to TestRail (8 tools) and BrowserStack (7 tools) for teams that need test management and cross-browser coverage. Both are optional — the plugin works fully without them.\n\nSmart hooks auto-validate every test file you write (catches waitForTimeout, hardcoded URLs, non-web-first assertions) and auto-detect Playwright projects on session start. Zero overhead — they run silently.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**, **3 agents**, **2 hooks** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `browserstack` (Run tests on BrowserStack), `coverage` (Analyze test coverage gaps), `fix` (Fix failing or flaky Playwright tests), `generate` (Generate Playwright tests), `init` (Set up Playwright in a project), `migrate` (Migrate from Cypress or Selenium to Playwright), `pw` (Production-grade Playwright testing toolkit), `report` (Generate test report), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (3): `migration-planner` (Analyzes Cypress or Selenium test suites and creates a file-by-file migration plan), `test-architect` (Plans test strategy for complex applications), `test-debugger` (Diagnoses flaky or failing Playwright tests using systematic taxonomy)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `pw-testrail`, `pw-browserstack`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install playwright-pro@claude-community` from `alirezarezvani/claude-skills` (`engineering-team/playwright-pro`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
